# REQUIRES: python-api
# Persistent simulations on the CPU (D196): segmented runs
# against uninterrupted ones, the coupling phase across boundaries, the
# energies of a final step of energy against `mdir run`, errors, stops, and
# ownership.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_segments.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir %t | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NVT: the coupling moves the velocities
# CHECK: NPT: the coupling moves the velocities
# CHECK: energies NVE Double: the rows of mdir run at steps 10 and 20 to every printed digit
# CHECK: energies NPT Mixed: the rows of mdir run at steps 10 and 20 to every printed digit
# CHECK: segmented runs, coupling phase, errors, stops and ownership passed
